The way the dark_room has been changed, the dark squares should
instead of being called "dark part of the room" be renamed to
something like "out of sight floor".

Also, even vanilla NetHack doesn't know about sky. For example in most
quest home levels you are supposed be on the surface, but throw an
object upwards and be surprised that there's a ceiling. :)

The biodiversity patch has fixed that but that part of the
biodiversity patch hasn't been picked up by variants yet. Because it
is only a minor issue, more pressing issue get higher priority.

